    "terrainName": "demo-city",
    "description": "What: On demo-city, with SUMO background traffic (the traffic settings: 600 cars, seed 1), four APCs ('Escort 1'..'Escort 4') stand in a column on the southbound three-lane avenue (SUMO edge e_axis_n_drop_d_3_6, lane 2 at x 145.2), 575 m north of the lit junction d_3_6 (stop line y 912). 'Escort 1' leads a road convoy (ConvoyOrder, Mode Traffic, Priority — handed to SUMO as the blue-light twin, H17) at 12 m/s to (145.2, 735), 175 m past the junction; the other three follow its path (Rank 1..3, Gap 15). The junction's straight-on light is green 0–41 s, yellow 41–45 s, red 45–90 s, so the column arrives in the red. Cars waiting at the red give way into the other lanes; the escort runs the red at the front, and its followers (our own bodies) never look at a light. Judge: (1) the lead runs PlatformConvoy; (2) it is handed to SUMO; (3) it crosses the junction while the light is red; (4) so does the tail; (5) the column never splits; (6) the lead reaches its destination. Check: scripts/scenario-regression.sh cv-red-lights"
  },
